{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/Jony-wws/Forex-wws2277/pull/1","repo":"Jony-wws/Forex-wws2277","number":1,"set":"agent","source":"devin","title":"TeamAgent — adaptive 1-5h + market_hours gate + 50+ stability metrics + premium UI + system self-audit","body":"## Summary\n\nState v1 (5-day stable target).\n\n**This commit (system self-audit):**\n- `teamagent/system_audit.py`: 15 self-consistency checks across 6 categories — paper_stats↔closed_trades, forecasts↔config.PAIRS, market_hours↔session, schema validity, code health, cross-module invariants. Returns `{overall_status, summary, categories[6], verdict_ru, recommendations_ru}` so the system can prove it does not contradict itself.\n- New endpoint `/api/system-audit` and a hero card \"ДОКАЗАТЕЛЬСТВА КОРРЕКТНОСТИ СИСТЕМЫ\" at the top of the dashboard, refreshed every 30s.\n- Issues the audit found and we fixed: NZDUSD silently dropped from forecasts.json (Yahoo rate-limit) → scanner now writes a self-describing `{skipped:true}` placeholder; PnL formula audit normalizes the fraction-vs-percent payout convention; qualified_pairs check uses the same loader as `stability_forecast` for apples-to-apples comparison.\n- Visual unification: every `.card` section now uses the purple gradient + purple borders (no new compositor layers, Android Chrome stays smooth).\n- 21 new tests in `test_system_audit.py` (3 corruption-detection tests included). Total 102/102 pass.\n\n**Earlier in PR:**\n- 50+ stability metrics (Wilson CI, bootstrap p5/p95, VaR/CVaR, Sharpe, Sortino, Brier, conformal coverage, Kelly half, profit factor, max drawdown, calmar, skew, kurtosis, hurst, variance ratio, streak, stress-test, realized vol, pair stability score, system stability report, min_guarantee_per_trade)\n- Market hours awareness (Sun 22:00 → Fri 22:00 UTC, all 3 strategies refuse new trades when market closes within buffer)\n- Adaptive 1-5h expiry in BOTH paper_trader and paper_trader_stakan, capped to next market close\n- Pre-emptive stability forecast (`/api/stability-forecast`) — expected WR for 1h/6h/24h regardless of closed-trade count\n- Premium SEO-AI-style UI: purple `#a78bfa` + dark `#0a0612`, count-up tweens, sparklines, mobile optimized (no `backdrop-filter`/`filter:blur` on touch)\n- Free 70% gate: paper_trader opens when `forecast.probability_pct ≥ 70`\n- 64 subprocess agents (28 specialists + 16 analyzers + 12 learners + 5 health + 3 LLM)\n\n## Review & Testing Checklist for Human\n\n- [ ] Open the dashboard and verify all 15 audit checks are 🟢 (\"единый организм\" badge in green)\n- [ ] On Android Chrome — pull-to-refresh and confirm the page is smooth (no lag, no jitter when countdown ticks)\n- [ ] Check `/api/system-audit` returns `overall_status: \"green\"` and `summary.total ≥ 15`\n- [ ] Watch for at least one full 5-min scanner cycle and confirm `forecasts.json` keeps all 28 pairs even if Yahoo rate-limits some\n\n### Notes\n\n- Forex market is closing in ~20 min (Fri 22:00 UTC). The system intentionally won't open new trades until Sun 22:00 UTC.\n- Closed-trades count is currently 5 → Wilson CI is wide (11.8%–76.9%), score 25.8/100. This is mathematically correct and honest, not a bug.\n- The audit will catch any future drift: if paper_stats stops matching closed_trades, if a state file gets corrupted schema, if the scanner loses a pair — the dashboard will turn red immediately.\n\nLink to Devin session: https://app.devin.ai/sessions/082b75f2888a45a3a4ae71a8877ad2dd\nRequested by: @Jony-wws\n<!-- devin-review-badge-begin -->\n\n---\n\n<a href=\"https://app.devin.ai/review/jony-wws/forex-wws2277/pull/1\" target=\"_blank\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://static.devin.ai/assets/gh-open-in-devin-review-dark.svg?v=1\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.devin.ai/assets/gh-open-in-devin-review-light.svg?v=1\" alt=\"Open in Devin Review\">\n  </picture>\n</a>\n<!-- devin-review-badge-end -->\n","authorType":"Bot","additions":78447,"deletio